Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 23:10:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 16/18] B70: quality-first drafts keep evidence citations
 instead of withholding

Rerun of the 11 withheld product prompts on c2e3848 delivered 7; two of the
remaining four failed only at the final draft check:

- citation_outside_frozen_evidence: links to URLs outside the frozen evidence
  are now unlinked (label kept, bare URL removed) before validation, so every
  remaining citation points at fetched evidence; unlinked URLs are logged.
- citations_missing: bare URLs from the frozen evidence now count as
  citations alongside Markdown links.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
